ghcap (0.13.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix Result<bool, _> versus Result<(), _> control-flow errors in CUI operations.
  * Keep repository clone as a repository-level action.
  * Add unit tests for GitHub remote URL parsing.
  * Keep the login URL visible before invoking gh auth login.

